OL,3,GNEWSATwo arson arrests over garage and
OL,4,Awarehouse fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been arrested on suspicion
OL,7,Fof arson after a large fire at a
OL,8,FMerseyside garage and furniture
OL,9,Fwarehouse.
OL,11,FThe blaze broke out at the site in
OL,12,FFernhill Road, Bootle, shortly after
OL,13,F20:00 BST on Tuesday.
OL,15,FThere were no injuries but nearby homes
OL,16,Fwere evacuated as a precaution and road
OL,17,Fclosures were put in place.
OL,19,FA 37-year-old man from Belle Vale in
OL,20,Fsouth Liverpool and a 28-year-old man
OL,21,Ffrom Kirkby was being held on suspicion
OL,22,Fof arson with intent to endanger life.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
